==Strategy==
Both enemies here have pretty low damage if you ignore their toxic, so using [[Immune to Toxic|Toxic Immune]] units should get you a pretty easy win. If you're struggling to complete this stage in a timely manner, the [[Cat Cannon#Cannon Types|Holy Blast]] Cannon is recommended to help get rid of the massive Zollow flocks.

==='''Recommended Units'''===
*[[:Category:Cats with Toxic Immunity|Toxic Immune Cats]]: Unsurprisingly. In particular, [[Salon Cat (Rare Cat)|Cyborg Cat]] with her Toxic Immune [[Talents|talent]] and [[Brainwashed Fish Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Brainwashed Island Cat]] both shred this entire stage.
*[[Swimmer Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Fishman Cat]]: Able to kill Gobble in only a couple of hits.
*[[:Category:Waver-class Cats|Wavers]] or [[:Category:Surge Attack Cats|Surgers]]: [[Crazed Gross Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Manic Macho Legs Cat]], [[Brainwashed Gross Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Brainwashed Macho Legs Cat]] and [[Slime Cat (Rare Cat)|Jelly Dumpling Cat]] help considerably with clearing out Zollow waves.
*[[Vaulter Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Housewife Cat]]: Deals good damage to Gobble and can get Z-Kills on Zollow with good enough timing.

