==Trivia==
*All enemies here have the [[Toxic|toxic]] ability.
*The titular "Dark Lord" may be [[Evil Emperor Cat]], who was introduced in the [[Version 10.1 Update]] following this stage's addition.
*This "Dark Lord" could potentially also be [[Infernal Tyrant Nyandam]].
**The enemies in this stage have the Toxic ability, just like Infernal Tyrant Nyandam.
**Evil Emperor Cat appears in a stage known as "Possessed by the Demon King" in Japanese. Infernal Tyrant Nyandam's name in Japanese is "Demon King Nyandam", suggesting that Evil Emperor is possessed by Nyandam.

